<title>USA: Emery USD, Calif., won by BancAmerica Securities.</title>
<headline>Emery USD, Calif., won by BancAmerica Securities.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>BancAmerica Securities said it won $2.690 million of Emery USD, Calif., general obligation bonds, Election of 1995, Series 1997, with a true interest cost of 5.43 percent.</p>
</text>
